{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X把几处关键心理因果压薄甚至改写了，尤其S06的孤单来源、S13想把喜欢藏回去又做不到的挣扎，人物心理的完整性不如Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的加亮锚点让我能先抓住每段发生了什么，感受词又按音乐节点出现，边听边扫更容易接住重点和音乐细节；它的声音、身体感受也更具体，有层次。Y对人物动机和前后心理转折交代得更完整，尤其解释了他为什么害怕、为什么反复收住、为什么最终不再隐藏，但长句加右侧词堆不如X容易即时读取。综合实际观看体验，我选X，不过它需要保留Y中那些不可随意压缩的心理因果。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3e2c97df-dda6-489b-be7b-8d466d33f7f3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T074517008276Z", "elapsed_seconds": 100.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:47:00.489153+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a2bb6fbe72da9dc3aafe09177d36e1a17022a77f66a271dcf1a3f23c12f5c0d1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\